    "sub_name": "企業管理專題研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "THE RESEARCH ON THE ISSUES OF BUSINESS MANAGEMENT(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在使同學們如何利用企業研究方法之概念去撰寫專題。內容包括：研究架構、研究設計、資料分析、及統計方法之介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "The objective of this course is designed to introduce students how to write a thesis by using business research method. The main topics include: research structure, research design, data Analysis, and statistical methods.",
    "pre_subname": "MGT1001管理學、MGT1002企業概論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MGT1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MGT1001 MANAGEMENT、MGT1002 INTRODUCTION TO BUSINESS",
